<title>USA: CSCE Brazil differential coffee stocks unchanged.</title>
<headline>CSCE Brazil differential coffee stocks unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The amount of coffee stored in warehouses and certified for delivery against CSCE's Brazilian Differential futures contract was 287 60-kg bags as of Dec 6, unchanged from the previous week.</p>
<p>The coffee was housed solely in New Orleans warehouses. There were no bags pending classification or certification in New York, San Francisco, Houston, Jacksonville or Norfolk.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
